---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
const areas = [{n:'01',title:'Education for opportunity',text:'Literacy, learning resources and pathways to a brighter future.',icon:'↗'},{n:'02',title:'Health with dignity',text:'Medical awareness and access to compassionate community support.',icon:'+'},{n:'03',title:'Stronger communities',text:'Food, shelter and skills that support independent lives.',icon:'♡'},{n:'04',title:'A greener tomorrow',text:'Environmental protection and care for the places we call home.',icon:'♧'}];
---
<Site title="Lifeline Development Trust | Together for a Better Tomorrow" description="Lifeline Development Trust in Sorada, Ganjam, Odisha is dedicated to education, healthcare and community development. Explore our objectives and get involved.">
<main>
<section class="hero"><img class="hero-photo" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/30073700/pexels-photo-30073700.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&h=650&w=940" alt="Illustrative photograph of children in India, not a Lifeline activity" width="940" height="650" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="hero-note">Illustrative photograph · Not a Trust activity</span><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 460 460"><path d="M230 356C180 318 77 254 77 172c0-89 110-112 153-40 43-72 153-49 153 40 0 82-103 146-153 184Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m68 289 85 48c23 13 50 17 76 11l99-24c22-6 18-32-4-31l-91 7-61-39c-16-10-36-10-52 0l-52 28Zm324-30-54 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span class="art-caption">HUMANITY · DIGNITY · OPPORTUNITY</span></div><div class="wrap hero-content"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> ROOTED IN SORADA. UNITED BY HUMANITY.</p><h1><span class="sr-only">LIFELINE DEVELOPMENT TRUST — </span>Together, We Build a <span>Better Tomorrow.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Every life deserves an opportunity to flourish. We stand for education, healthcare and social development — with people at the heart of everything.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button gold" href="/programs">Explore Our Work <span>↗</span></a><a class="button outline" href="/contact#volunteer">Become a Volunteer <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Sorada · Ganjam · Odisha, India</span><a href="#introduction">Discover our purpose ↓</a></div></div></section>
<section id="introduction" class="section wrap intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SHARED PURPOSE</p><h2>Small acts of care.<br/>Lasting possibilities.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Lifeline Development Trust brings a community-first outlook to charitable development in Sorada, Ganjam, Odisha.</p><p>Our stated objectives connect education, medical relief, support for people facing hardship, cultural wellbeing and environmental protection. Our purpose is simple: a more equal, compassionate society where everyone has room to grow.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know Lifeline <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="aqua-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE FIRST. ALWAYS.</p><h2>Where we aim to make a difference.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/programs">All charitable objectives ↗</a></div><div class="focus-grid">{areas.map(a=><article class="focus-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="number">{a.n}</span><span class="area-icon">{a.icon}</span></div><h3>{a.title}</h3><p>{a.text}</p><a href="/programs" aria-label={`Explore ${a.title}`}>Explore objective ↗</a></article>)}</div><p class="disclosure">These are our charitable objectives. Completed projects and measured outcomes will be published only when verified.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap section purpose-grid"><div class="purpose-card"><p class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Care that reaches further.</h2><p>To advance education, promote health awareness and support people facing hardship through inclusive, community-focused charitable work.</p></div><div class="purpose-card vision"><p class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</p><h2>Opportunity without barriers.</h2><p>A society where dignity, equality, learning and wellbeing are within everyone’s reach, and communities can shape their own futures.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap section gallery-preview"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM OUR COMMUNITY</p><h2>The people. The purpose.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/gallery">Visit the gallery ↗</a></div><div class="preview-images"><figure><img src="/uploads/chat-790b55dc012bcf8a5f06610c803cd8a75c45a5b9172d1373788f3f9e4526bec6.webp" alt="Lifeline Development Trust Diwali greeting supplied by the organization" width="940" height="650" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Community greetings · Organization-supplied image</figcaption></figure><figure class="portrait-preview"><img src="/uploads/chat-8a50356365ab64842c0210deafdfaf6ecfb2a0c675f723104d3f4f26924ea3ee.webp" alt="Mr. Siba Sankar panda, President of Lifeline Development Trust" width="365" height="480"/><figcaption><strong>Mr. Siba Sankar panda</strong><br/>President<br/><a href="tel:+919937347566">+91 99373 47566</a></figcaption></figure><figure class="portrait-preview"><img src="/uploads/chat-03bcaff5407341ca13dacde5d267d3f93f24129c8451542951101528f64591c4.webp" alt="Dr. Rajendra Prasad Patro, Secretary of Lifeline Development Trust" width="365" height="480" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>Dr.Rajendra Prasad Patro</strong><br/>Secretary<br/><a href="tel:+919348099633">+91 93480 99633</a></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="cta-section"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">THERE IS A PLACE FOR YOU HERE</p><h2>A better tomorrow<br/>begins with us.</h2><p>Give your time, share your skills, or start a conversation about supporting our purpose.</p></div><div class="cta-buttons"><a class="button gold" href="/contact#donate">Enquire About Giving ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="/contact#volunteer">Volunteer With Us →</a></div></div></section>
</main></Site>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .preview-images { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .preview-images figure { margin-inline: 0; min-width: 0; }
    .preview-images .portrait-preview img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 100%; }
    .portrait-preview figcaption { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  }
</style>